.TH WELLGPU 1 "August 2026" "wellgpu 1.0" "wellutils"
.SH NAME
Wellgpu \- graphics adapter overview: bus, vendor, driver and live NVIDIA statistics
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wellgpu
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B wellgpu
.PP
Lists graphics adapters (VGA and 3D controllers) with their PCI bus
address, vendor, device model and the kernel driver in use. When an
NVIDIA adapter with the proprietary driver is present, a second section
shows live statistics from \fBnvidia-smi\fR: driver version, VRAM usage,
temperature, utilization, GPU/memory clocks, power draw and fan speed.
.PP
When stdout is a terminal the output is drawn as a box; when piped a plain layout is used.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show usage and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print version and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-lang " ru|en|auto"
Force report language (default \fBauto\fR).
.TP
.BI \-\-color " always|never|auto"
Force, disable, or auto-detect ANSI colour.
.TP
.B \-\-plain
Plain text output without box drawing.
.TP
.B \-\-box
Force box drawing even when piped.
.TP
.B \-\-no-emoji
Disable emoji icons.
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Enable verbose tracing.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 2
Invalid command-line usage.
.TP
.B 3
Unexpected runtime error.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B WELLUTILS_LANG
\fBru\fR or \fBen\fR; overrides locale detection.
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
Disables colour in auto mode.
.SH AUTHOR
wellbou_
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR wellutils (1), .BR wellcpu (1), .BR wellblock (1)
